Package: boxd-client
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: boxd maintainers <gsalucci@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), rsync, openssh-client, git
Suggests: podman | docker.io
Homepage: https://github.com/gsalucci/boxd
Description: build boxes for agents: the box command
 The box command for the machine that sends work. Run in a git worktree it
 syncs the worktree to a boxd build server and runs the command in that
 worktree's own box. box setup <host> writes the ssh entry and installs the
 Claude skill for the user.
